 "decision": "Promo owner feedback 2026-11-12: TALON's carry frames (and the free-flight set drawn to match them) looked washed out beside his 37 px rung frames. Measured over opaque pixels, the sheet averaged luminance 88 (sd 14) with ink on every silhouette pixel; carry averaged 126 with no ink at all, free flight 112 with a slate-deep silhouette.",
